cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Residual_Assembler: model-agnostic residual assembly and structural sensitivities for Abaqus models"
abstract: >-
  Abaqus owns the global residual internally and never exposes it, so an Abaqus
  user cannot supply one directly. Residual_Assembler builds R from the
  ingredients instead: mesh, element kernels, material response, converged
  solution fields, loads and constraints. Given a converged solution and a
  parameter list it assembles the residual and differentiates it, producing
  structural sensitivities without the model leaving the user's machine. It is
  the companion product to UMAT-OTI, which supplies the differentiated material.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
